面。两人分享MBTI（杰INFJ，鸫ENFP）感叹很合拍。风见鸫提议帮他找女朋友，夏油杰立刻反感拒绝。随后夏油杰辅导风见鸫做数学题，并送来桃子挞。互道晚安时，风见鸫内心希望可靠的弟弟能多依赖自己一点。","startMessageIndex":0,"lastMessageIndex":304,"startMessageId":1779634085542,"endMessageId":1779722998540,"messageCount":304,"dateRange":{"start":"2006-05-24 23:05","end":"2006-05-25 23:45"},"source":"online","keywords":["小鸫","小杰","薄巧","笼屉面","MBTI","桃子挞","2026-05-24 23:05","2026-05-25 23:45"],"importance":3,"emotion":"tender","topics":["日常","感情","學業"],"openThreads":[],"evidencedFacts":["user的MBTI是ENFP","user喜欢薄荷巧克力口味","user数学较弱"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"customRange":null,"__v4StanceText":"听到她说最喜欢我时很安心，但我绝不需要她帮我找女朋友。她什么时候才能明白，我不想只做可靠的弟弟？","__relationalGrowthText":null,"__selfGrowthText":null,"__growthText":null,"userId":"uid_1779425914905_mxm8yr2y5","characterId":"8b5162f8-049e-4757-bb2f-30028b00e44c"}]